#: breakpoint.c:15020
msgid ""
"Set a watchpoint for EXPRESSION.\n"
"Usage: watch [-location] EXPRESSION\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"%OPTIONS%\n"
"\n"
"A watchpoint stops execution of your program whenever the value of\n"
"an expression changes."
