#: f-lang.c:1824
msgid ""
"When the user requests a slice of a Fortran array then we can either return\n"
"a descriptor that describes the array in place (using the original array "
"data\n"
"in its existing location) or the original data can be repacked (copied) to "
"a\n"
"new location.\n"
"\n"
"When the content of the array slice is contiguous within the original array\n"
"then the result will never be repacked, but when the data for the new array\n"
"is non-contiguous within the original array repacking will only be "
"performed\n"
"when this setting is on."
msgstr ""

